  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "二零零六年十二月十六日，早上八点，东京西新宿。",
      "sha256": "092d648176acb17c6b64c5951a70cfac0cb7b3bf40b4838b1345717a6ab7cb56",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.2,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "路人报警，说路边立着一具假人模特。",
      "sha256": "28494ef26c440d2bc43c0db1cd0062853172ada5a4518bdf887c07efad1b991b",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 6.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.83,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.17
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "警察到得很快，拉起黄色警戒带。",
      "sha256": "5951feca736d45aeb9d00a17ca27f6f96593c4824602e760607026a844de4008",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 10.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "十二天后，涩谷一处空宅的院子里，又发现了下半身。",
      "sha256": "9256526842f8351f1e3725461f8373f3df671363394ba29f2291dc5ea22ea6d5",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 16.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.92,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.08
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "两处遗体的样本比对一致，死者是三十岁的三桥祐辅。",
      "sha256": "24bcbe25bf083ba4b67200beecd65684563a89b8eb3fe1d0f579bf38d6823d3a",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 22.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.73,
      "atempo": 1.1217,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "他在一家外资不动产投资公司做分析师。",
      "sha256": "c42f6fb520b86ef9e0eda25ebc052eba4794ed036b91650a7753071654514ae1",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 28.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.13,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.87
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "妻子前一天刚去警署报了失踪。",
      "sha256": "b21f1eb53f84a80bb9178db07d40efec1c211704b742f52c1700c640850f2666",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 34.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.02,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.98
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "她写的身高一米六六，胸口有一道手术疤。",
      "sha256": "0c335e90c6e87ccfeb83c4847b6b8c5ea78035027967c1eb81c7aa8f7e2d848f",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 40.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.13,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.87
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "可新宿找到的那具遗体，胸口什么都没有。",
      "sha256": "b4360d5b4fb236f5f42fa34d95e55aadcecf3328c1ba01af46e30836ea389979",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 46.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.83,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.17
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "丈夫最后一次出现在监控里，是十二月十二日清晨。",
      "sha256": "fae4f3e95b5519c51df19ca8aa9589b6377f695de5c30810bba8f360d179c63b",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 52.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.31,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.69
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "此后的监控里，他再没出来过。",
      "sha256": "b3f5f04b6f612e5df2930a688133872b6baa74d16e7e03a2306ab08b195f631c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 58.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.32,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.68
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "十四日夜里十点，她拖着一只大行李箱下楼。",
      "sha256": "f9c97c3beabe9e205a1191acfef087d73ebb9799c7a5558fdbf24eacad594904",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 64.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.13,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 4.87
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "四个小时后，她空着手回来。",
      "sha256": "ecad2c9b3a810bc4c9d9cce924cf1f7d6db7e29fccff25401e38ab63620267c1",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 73.0,
      "target_duration": 3,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.89,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.11
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "十五分钟后，她又推了一辆手推车出去。",
      "sha256": "8b73a5aca3fc41a256a18a0f94add21ffa566959d094da9da10a49729523ca8d",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 76.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.24,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.76
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "二十分钟后，车没了，人也空手回来。",
      "sha256": "ac3ab234284673548639e32f5c3fd9834f5b33958f2edffc0ea4f516f86ad342",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 82.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.7,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "警方后来在电梯记录里，把这四个小时圈了出来。",
      "sha256": "1f36ccfa63e6b557f9544f0a14983841c87b4e08eb9bef9974e488e805ea0b23",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 88.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.6,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "她家里刚做过装修，地板是新换的。",
      "sha256": "84f668400ee56e865b2fe83793f90df791e7196761df1cc2b79667e7c8b95b19",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 94.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "被放倒的柜子里，铺着二十袋种植土。",
      "sha256": "076500779671d120b00eaf16960b7ab5c42accb891305d894b74f55bfb53cd55",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 100.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "土和三桥祐辅身上的土，成分一致。",
      "sha256": "b1672be0abaaa5ad18142af09c3fbdf38fba474ee0a3bd8db0228fae3ca6e48c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 106.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.7,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "三桥歌织在被捕后，供述了全部过程。",
      "sha256": "cf7fed5daf786e245c11ba12cdd71d27da71df1a316dc2a873c1e186a8d493b4",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 112.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.83,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.17
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "她说，十二月十二日早上，他喝醉了回家。",
      "sha256": "316b95aec7cb979be051ed81cc652cd84b64491c71fd9db52965d0b09a08a1e3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 118.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.31,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.69
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "她提出离婚，他把离婚申请书撕了。",
      "sha256": "ab966689aebf0bf13aeda17bbe5ee49dc2c4bf16e7676cefbb549a9cdb234b69",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 124.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.5,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.5
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "律师说，她长期被家暴，患上了创伤后应激障碍。",
      "sha256": "a5667797b42a162928bddfff6553336b0cb824e657460f22b71aa6b1f478f37c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 130.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "二零零五年六月，她的鼻骨被打断，进过庇护所。",
      "sha256": "f5f2ccb7ca38257d3b201727fca47d4f1e09099d2e7b5e04f83ac89afc4eb150",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 136.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.52,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.48
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "辩方主张她当时心神丧失，应当无罪。",
      "sha256": "720eb2be6e41d7e524ed64c2429d238769771eefa02817bc510dab9333005452",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 142.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.6,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "二零零八年四月二十八日，东京地裁给出结论。",
      "sha256": "b5a5dde66b24ea39e7a16dc3013f4731fa27993cdb76d513911cab664dab03b7",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 148.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.31,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.69
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "幻视幻听存在，但没有影响到责任能力。",
      "sha256": "203663044d683e68ac7d38a441bbb1910e87edd319304d7debdbf9ea9385d70f",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 154.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.62,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "求刑二十年，判了十五年。",
      "sha256": "bd1049abc666e9d56ba6b05bc27130412807718c66205d995d889b2e0211d226",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 160.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.89,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.11
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "二零一零年六月，东京高裁驳回上诉，辩方放弃上告，十五年就此确定。",
      "sha256": "6f945494a9858e3e44d59308c0898b240186e6f59c4ca2fa3313a6452919429a",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 166.0,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.93,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.07
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "从报案到刑期确定，隔了三年半；那四个小时，监控记得清清楚楚。",
      "sha256": "e279ae1eb2d9057466bb3f91af5b3b6e9b6442da7e5f43e587cb271b77890c45",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉克制的普通话男声，叙事纪录片口吻",
